sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker (ticket branch, any host)
    participant O as Orchestrator (user's machine)
    participant U as User
    W->>W: build, self-review
    W->>W: write agent/show/<feature>/NN-<slug>/demo
    W->>W: run it, paste the command and that run's output
    W->>O: closing comment: what landed, Demo, I need from you, Details
    O->>O: dispatch review renders the page from the unmerged branch
    O->>O: run the demo file on this machine
    O->>U: open what it produced beside the review page
    U->>O: ruling: accept, amend, redo, reject
    O->>W: amend: the comments, as guidance on resume
    O->>O: accept: merge --no-ff, dependents join the frontier
